# DNP3 outstation (SPEC 4.2): server.xml is the shape of bennu's sample (one binary and one analog input, a binary output and an
# SBO analog output) plus a direct analog output at address 2, so a master can operate both kinds. No XML comment in it: the stock
# parser exits silently on one before the root element.
# Listens on 127.0.0.1:20000, outstation address 10, master address 1.
CFG=${CFG:-${here:-/conformance}/${proto:-dnp3}/server.xml}
STOCK_CMD='LD_LIBRARY_PATH=/usr/local/lib bennu-field-device --f /tmp/cfg.xml'
WARMUP=4
CAPTURE_FILTER='tcp port 20000'
PROTO_FILTER=dnp3
ZEEK_LOAD='icsnpp-dnp3'
